WEBVTT

00:09:59.674 --> 00:10:03.143
that will help deal with the stress
that they are under.

00:10:03.547 --> 00:10:06.473
And it will give them
more mental-health options

00:10:06.497 --> 00:10:08.297
that they desperately need.

00:10:10.585 --> 00:10:13.332
We now have yoga classes in fire stations.

00:10:13.356 --> 00:10:15.275
(Laughter)

00:10:15.299 --> 00:10:18.831
(Applause)

00:10:18.855 --> 00:10:22.386
We've also provided on-duty
massages, which is fabulous.

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:23.871
(Laughter)

00:10:23.895 --> 00:10:26.568
And we have some off-duty programs
that we've started,

00:10:26.592 --> 00:10:30.397
like cooking classes for first responders
and their significant other